# Local capture inputs for the proof deck. The generated `proof-data.json` is committed because
# `/proof` reads it at runtime; these are the raw recordings it was built from, plus a local
# preview render, and they are regenerated by scripts/capture_exchange.py and buy_showcase.py.
.exchange.json
.showcase.json
.proof-preview.html
